  "body": "Stacked on #961 (Air M7 coolant on the Carvera post). Fork synced at v0.18.0.\n\n**What changed.** New built-in machine `assets/machines/makera-z1.mch` (\"Makera Z1\"), registered in `posting::MACHINES`: mill, mm, X/Y +-200 and Z +-100 mm, spindle 0-13000 rpm / 0.15 kW, axes 1200 mm/min, no tool changer stated (manual quick-change), coolant Air M7. Posts through the existing `carvera.cps`.\n\n**Sources** (published only; details in `docs/decisions/868-makera-z1.md`): makera.com Z1 vs Carvera Air and Z1 review pages (work area, 150 W, quick change, blower); cnx-software Z1 review (13000 rpm, 1200 mm/min; a conflicting 15000 rpm claim elsewhere rejected, lower value kept). No Fusion/HSMWorks material.\n\n**Not confirmed.** The Z1's G-code dialect matching carvera.cps is NOT published; recorded in the decision file. M7 for the blower is assumed from the issue/Carvera family. Manual tool change is posted as the Carvera M6 sequence.\n\n**Tests.** `crates/app/tests/makera_z1.rs`: `the_z1_is_listed_and_states_makeras_figures`, `a_default_op_on_the_z1_posts_m7_m9_through_the_carvera_post`, `travel_past_the_z1_refuses_by_name`, `a_tool_past_the_z1s_spindle_ceiling_refuses_by_name`; `machine.rs` built-in list updated. `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/issue/869-coolant-air` green; carvera_machines, carvera_post, coolant_air, machine, machine_library run by hand, green.\n\n**Not exercised.** A real Z1; UI pane listing beyond the library test; clippy beyond the gate.\n\nChangelog: Built-in machine Makera Z1 (Air M7, posts through the Carvera post) (#868)\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #868\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
